  "overview": "I went to Kiên Giang expecting island sun, forest runs, Ma Thiên Lãnh peak, Nam Du, and snorkeling at Hòn Hai Bờ Đập. Instead, five out of seven days came with rain. Not exactly the postcard version, but still a funny little lesson: sometimes the island trip becomes a storm trip.\n\nRạch Giá food was easy to love, especially grilled dried squid and coffee by the sea. I also lost my AirPods, chased the location for two days, then lost a power bank the day after. That was how the trip signed off.",
